                <span class="relative inline-flex size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            </span>
            <span>
                <span class="font-medium text-foreground">3 unread messages</span> from your team.
                <a href="#" class="font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-muted-foreground">
